  m_Name: Tema_NovaRetencao
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::ThemedPhaseData
  _themeName: "Nova Reten\xE7\xE3o"
  _themeNameEn: New Gridlock
  _summary: "Capital onde o tr\xE2nsito j\xE1 faz parte do endere\xE7o."
  _summaryEn: A capital where traffic is part of the address.
  _opening: "A capital cresceu, os carros cresceram mais e o sem\xE1foro virou ponto
    de encontro. Voc\xEA tem 20 turnos para fazer a cidade andar antes que seu Arnaldo
    desista do t\xE1xi."
  _openingEn: The capital grew, the cars grew faster and the traffic light became
    a meeting point. You have 20 turns to get the city moving before Mr. Arnaldo
    gives up on his taxi.
  _victory: "O tr\xE2nsito n\xE3o acabou, mas a cidade chegou ao fim dos 20 turnos
    andando."
  _victoryEn: Traffic is not gone, but the city reached the end of its 20 turns still
    moving.
  _inspiration: "Cidade fict\xEDcia. Em 2025, motoristas de S\xE3o Paulo perderam
    cerca de 132 horas em congestionamentos (TomTom Traffic Index)."
  _inspirationEn: "Fictional city. In 2025, drivers in S\xE3o Paulo lost about 132
    hours to congestion (TomTom Traffic Index)."
  _knowledgeEntry: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a75a8c997a5c04a2ab052dda35d337f, type: 2}
